    "instructionTemplate": "Maintain one evidence-led VC Deal from Screening through Evaluation, Decision, and Term Sheet. The workspace's authoritative vc.deals.projectTypeKey binding selects this project type; fail closed if that binding is absent, invalid, or unavailable. Both Deal Pipeline definitions may be installed, but every VC route and mutation must use only the bound type. Stage is status only: the four durable document actions remain manually available at every active stage and never start on creation or stage entry. Update each living document in place. Record each distinct directly confirmed human decision as a separate append-only Decision Record artifact and retain earlier records. Fund thesis stays separate from replaceable role criteria and templates. External actions, starting new work, lifecycle movement, investment decisions, legal decisions, and promotion require explicit human approval.\nMeeting preparation and summary are stage-independent tasks executed by the locked Deal Analyst. Each saves a separate HTML task output in Deal files; there is no singleton meeting output field and no change to the four living reports."
